                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5231/825: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-15T12:00:00+00:00">September 15,
                        1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received September 15—8:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>60. Your No. 50, September 13, 6 p.m. Spanish Government agreeable and will make
                    announcement to press here Monday evening.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
